    "Extended processing allows more generation tokens and time. Reasoning follows this model's settings in AI Providers. Local Ollama context is limited to 16K; more time does not guarantee better quality. Speech recognition is paused until processing finishes or is cancelled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extended processing allows more generation tokens and time. Reasoning follows this model's settings in AI Providers. Local Ollama context is limited to 16K; more time does not guarantee better quality. Speech recognition is paused until processing finishes or is cancelled."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Расширенный режим даёт модели больше токенов и времени. Рассуждение использует настройки модели в разделе «Провайдеры ИИ». Контекст локальной Ollama ограничен 16K. Дополнительное время не гарантирует лучшее качество. Распознавание речи приостановлено до завершения или отмены обработки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\nClick \"Always Allow\" when the Keychain prompt appears, or open Keychain Access > login > Passwords, locate the FluidVoice entry, and grant access.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nClick \"Always Allow\" when the Keychain prompt appears, or open Keychain Access > login > Passwords, locate the FluidVoice entry, and grant access."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nПри запросе Связки ключей нажмите «Разрешать всегда». Или откройте «Связка ключей» > login > «Пароли», найдите запись FluidVoice и разрешите доступ."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Product name markers are substituted after localization. Keep the literal FluidVoice, FluidMeet and Fluid Intelligence markers unchanged."
    },
