    "I think I'm gonna meet you tomorrow at 3 p.m. Let me know if the time works. If not, we can figure out some other time.\n\nAlso, I think you need to fix the bug. Please let me know if you need some help there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I think I'm gonna meet you tomorrow at 3 p.m. Let me know if the time works. If not, we can figure out some other time.\n\nAlso, I think you need to fix the bug. Please let me know if you need some help there."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Думаю, мы встретимся завтра в 15:00. Напишите, удобно ли вам это время. Если нет, выберем другое.\n\nЕщё, кажется, нужно исправить ошибку. Скажите, если понадобится помощь."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I think I'm gonna meet you tomorrow at 3 p.m. Let me know if the time works. If not, we can figure out some other time. Also, I think you need to fix the bug. Please let me know if you need some help there.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I think I'm gonna meet you tomorrow at 3 p.m. Let me know if the time works. If not, we can figure out some other time. Also, I think you need to fix the bug. Please let me know if you need some help there."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Думаю, мы встретимся завтра в 15:00. Напишите, удобно ли вам это время. Если нет, выберем другое. Ещё, кажется, нужно исправить ошибку. Скажите, если понадобится помощь."
          }
        }
      }
    },
