    "Relative library ratings for Russian: speed 90%, accuracy 90%. These are product scores, not measured transcription accuracy. Reference speed: 8.48 seconds of synthetic Russian speech processed in 0.97 seconds on an Apple M4 Max CPU, excluding model loading. The publisher reports average WER of 12.0% for the base GigaAM v3 E2E CTC across ten datasets. Lower WER is better. The optimized export has not been evaluated on those datasets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relative library ratings for Russian: speed 90%, accuracy 90%. These are product scores, not measured transcription accuracy. Reference speed: 8.48 seconds of synthetic Russian speech processed in 0.97 seconds on an Apple M4 Max CPU, excluding model loading. The publisher reports average WER of 12.0% for the base GigaAM v3 E2E CTC across ten datasets. Lower WER is better. The optimized export has not been evaluated on those datasets."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Относительные оценки библиотеки для русского языка: скорость 90%, точность 90%. Это оценки модели, а не измеренный процент правильно распознанных слов. Замер скорости: 8,48 секунды синтетической русской речи обработаны за 0,97 секунды на CPU Apple M4 Max, без учёта загрузки модели. Разработчик сообщает среднюю долю ошибок в словах WER 12,0% для базовой GigaAM v3 E2E CTC по десяти наборам данных. Чем ниже WER, тем лучше. Оптимизированный вариант на этих наборах не оценивался."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Relative library ratings for Russian: speed 90%, accuracy 90%. These are product scores, not measured transcription accuracy. CPU speed has not been benchmarked for this export. The publisher reports average WER of 9.1% for the base GigaAM v3 CTC across ten datasets. Lower WER is better. The optimized export has not been evaluated on those datasets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Relative library ratings for Russian: speed 90%, accuracy 90%. These are product scores, not measured transcription accuracy. CPU speed has not been benchmarked for this export. The publisher reports average WER of 9.1% for the base GigaAM v3 CTC across ten datasets. Lower WER is better. The optimized export has not been evaluated on those datasets."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Относительные оценки библиотеки для русского языка: скорость 90%, точность 90%. Это оценки модели, а не измеренный процент правильно распознанных слов. Скорость на CPU для этого варианта не измерена. Разработчик сообщает среднюю долю ошибок в словах WER 9,1% для базовой GigaAM v3 CTC по десяти наборам данных. Чем ниже WER, тем лучше. Оптимизированный вариант на этих наборах не оценивался."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Punctuation, capitalization and text normalization. Compact INT8 model.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
