    "Set up your voice so matching speech is labelled You in future meetings. The voice profile stays on this device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up your voice so matching speech is labelled You in future meetings. The voice profile stays on this device."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Настройте свой голос, чтобы в следующих встречах ваша речь отмечалась как «Вы». Голосовой профиль хранится на этом устройстве."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read aloud at a natural pace for 15 to 20 seconds. Audio stays in memory and is discarded after checking. Only Save stores the voice profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read aloud at a natural pace for 15 to 20 seconds. Audio stays in memory and is discarded after checking. Only Save stores the voice profile."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Читайте вслух в обычном темпе в течение 15-20 секунд. Аудио остаётся в памяти и удаляется после проверки. Голосовой профиль сохраняется только по кнопке «Сохранить»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today I am setting up my voice for meeting transcripts. I speak at a natural pace and keep the microphone at a comfortable distance. This sample helps the app distinguish my voice from other people. I can remove my voice profile in Settings at any time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
